  cat:measuredBytes rdfs:comment "Sum of working-tree byte sizes of matching tracked files, compressed files counted as stored; not HTTP compressed size, unique facts, ignored raw downloads or Git history." .
  cat:registeredMetadata rdfs:comment "Original source or artifact register object as JSON text; records reported assertions without turning them into a new grant." .
  cat:sourcePeriodNote rdfs:comment "Recorded dates/period wording, not automatically schema:temporalCoverage." .
  cat:changeRateAssessment rdfs:comment "Expected source/output change behaviour; inferred from workflow or source type, not measured churn." .
  cat:servingAssessment rdfs:comment "Operational recommendation or current architecture, not a performance measurement." .
  cat:rightsAssessment rdfs:comment "Reuse assessment; source-specific primary licence terms govern." .
  cat:trackedFileCount rdfs:comment "Number of tracked files measured in storage family." .
  cat:unmatchedPattern rdfs:comment "No matching tracked file at audited checkout; may be future, ignored, directory, obsolete or hosted elsewhere; not proof absent everywhere." .
