  cat:source_copernicus_glo30 schema:description "Copernicus DEM GLO-30 (a 30 m digital surface model, EGM2008 heights), 1 x 1 degree Cloud Optimized GeoTIFFs on the AWS Registry of Open Data (bucket copernicus-dem-30m), read by HTTP range requests (a window round the place). Source listed by the project data register; listing alone does not prove acquisition or inclusion in all derived outputs." .
