  cat:source_copernicus_glo30 schema:creditText "Copernicus DEM GLO-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA" .
  cat:source_copernicus_glo30 schema:publisher "European Space Agency (ESA) and the European Union (Copernicus); DLR e.V. and Airbus Defence and Space GmbH (TanDEM-X)" .
  cat:source_copernicus_glo30 cat:registeredMetadata "{\"attribution\": \"Copernicus DEM GLO-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA\", \"licence\": \"Copernicus DEM licence (ESA / European Union, GLO-30 public instance): free of charge, worldwide, for any purpose, including redistribution of derived products, with the attribution\", \"licence_url\": \"https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/explore-data/data-collections/copernicus-contributing-missions/collections-description/COP-DEM\", \"name\": \"Copernicus DEM GLO-30 (a 30 m digital surface model, EGM2008 heights), 1 x 1 degree Cloud Optimized GeoTIFFs on the AWS Registry of Open Data (bucket copernicus-dem-30m), read by HTTP range requests (a window round the place)\", \"note\": \"Used for the place Sarajevo (region config sarajevo, adapter world-base): the terrain of the tiles and the ground under each building. A surface model: in built-up cells the roofs and trees raise it a few metres. The raw window stays in cwplans/data/raw/places/sarajevo/ (not committed); the committed tiles hold a 33 x 33 heightfield per tile a 33 x 33 grid in features.json and a 97 x 97 grid of the 8 km terrain ring, resampled from it. The full licence text names an 'all rights reserved' notice in the credit line; re-check before the prototyping phase ends. Also used for the German places (2026-10-22: berlin, stuttgart, dagstuhl; sets in danbri/docklandia data/de/).\", \"publisher\": \"European Space Agency (ESA) and the European Union (Copernicus); DLR e.V. and Airbus Defence and Space GmbH (TanDEM-X)\", \"url\": \"https://registry.opendata.aws/copernicus-dem/\"}" .
  cat:source_copernicus_glo30 cat:recordStatus "Referenced source; distribution/harvest extent must be established from artifact and manifest links." .
