  cat:source_ms_buildings cat:registeredMetadata "{\"attribution\": \"© Microsoft (Global ML Building Footprints, ODbL 1.0)\", \"licence\": \"ODbL 1.0\", \"licence_class\": \"share-alike\", \"licence_url\": \"https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/\", \"name\": \"Microsoft Global ML Building Footprints, release 2026-02-03 (gzip GeoJSON lines per zoom-9 quadkey, dataset-links.csv); height in metres where estimated\", \"note\": \"Allowed by the owner on 2026-10-20 (\\\"Use ms/overture\\\"). Used for the places on the globe (adapter world-ms-buildings): the height of a footprint that matches an OSM outline with no OSM height or levels. The quadkey files stay in cwplans/data/raw/places/<id>/; only footprints in the area with a height > 0 are committed in places/<id>/sources/ms-buildings.json. Sarajevo quadkey 120233030: 164,318 footprints, none with a height; León quadkey 031333200: 18,919 of 57,779 with a height. Also used for the German places (2026-10-22: berlin, stuttgart, dagstuhl; sets in danbri/docklandia data/de/).\", \"publisher\": \"Microsoft (Bing Maps)\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/microsoft/GlobalMLBuildingFootprints\"}" .
