  cat:source_overture_ign_geometry schema:publisher "Instituto Geográfico Nacional (España), via the Overture Maps Foundation buildings theme" .
  cat:source_overture_ign_geometry cat:registeredMetadata "{\"attribution\": \"Some city buildings: Instituto Geográfico Nacional (España) via Overture Maps (licence not stated; kept apart, under review)\", \"licence\": \"not stated: the Overture sources entry of these records has an empty licence field (IGN data are generally CC BY 4.0; not confirmed for these records)\", \"licence_class\": \"review\", \"licence_url\": \"https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/\", \"name\": \"Overture Maps buildings, release 2026-09-23.1: the footprints of the records whose geometry source is \\\"Instituto Geográfico Nacional (España)\\\" (provider ign_es), over the León city box\", \"note\": \"Read from the city buildings answer of the Overture query (raw, not committed); only the transformed blocks (oriented boxes or simplified outlines, flat tops) are in the tiles.\", \"publisher\": \"Instituto Geográfico Nacional (España), via the Overture Maps Foundation buildings theme\", \"review\": \"Owner, 2026-10-20: \\\"substantially more city\\\"; on the IGN data: \\\"use the data but keep it distinct and easy to remove if requested\\\". Drawn as blocks of the León city ring only where OSM has no building, as its own geometry class \\\"ign\\\" (adapter overture-ign-geometry, docklands/geo/adapters/world-surround.js). Remove: delete the id in place.surround.geometry of docklands/geo/regions/leon.js and rebuild. Ask IGN / Overture for the licence of these records.\", \"review_exit\": \"catastro-ign\", \"url\": \"https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/\"}" .
  cat:source_overture_ign_geometry cat:recordStatus "Referenced source; distribution/harvest extent must be established from artifact and manifest links." .
