  cat:source_overture_ms_geometry cat:registeredMetadata "{\"attribution\": \"Some city buildings: Microsoft ML Buildings via Overture Maps © Microsoft (ODbL 1.0)\", \"licence\": \"ODbL 1.0\", \"licence_class\": \"share-alike\", \"licence_url\": \"https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/\", \"name\": \"Overture Maps buildings, release 2026-09-23.1: the footprints of the records whose geometry source is \\\"Microsoft ML Buildings\\\", over the city boxes of León and Sarajevo and over Greater London (the GLA boundary)\", \"note\": \"Owner, 2026-10-20: \\\"Use ms/overture\\\" (CLAUDE.md, data policy); Greater London: owner, 2026-10-22, \\\"yes\\\" to \\\"Microsoft footprints in London where OSM has none\\\". Drawn as blocks only where OSM has no building (a footprint that overlaps an OSM outline is dropped), as its own geometry class \\\"ms\\\" (adapter overture-ms-geometry): in the city ring of León and Sarajevo, and in Greater London (405,101 selected, 171 dropped for overlap, 349,432 drawn at 25 m2 or more). Remove: delete the id in place.surround.geometry (León, Sarajevo) or place.blocks.geometry (docklands/geo/regions/london.js) and rebuild. Raw answer not committed. Also used for the German places (2026-10-22: berlin, stuttgart, dagstuhl; sets in danbri/docklandia data/de/).\", \"publisher\": \"Microsoft (Global ML Building Footprints), via the Overture Maps Foundation buildings theme\", \"url\": \"https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/\"}" .
