  cat:source_de_be_lod2 schema:publisher "Senatsverwaltung für Stadtentwicklung, Bauen und Wohnen Berlin (Geoportal Berlin)" .
  cat:source_de_be_lod2 cat:registeredMetadata "{\"attribution\": \"Geoportal Berlin / 3D-Gebäudemodelle im Level of Detail 2 (LoD 2), dl-de/zero-2.0 (no credit required; given)\", \"licence\": \"Datenlizenz Deutschland – Zero – Version 2.0 (dl-de/zero-2.0)\", \"licence_class\": \"open\", \"licence_url\": \"https://www.govdata.de/dl-de/zero-2-0\", \"name\": \"3D-Gebäudemodelle im Level of Detail 2 (LoD 2), Land Berlin: CityGML 1.0 (AdV profile), 1 x 1 km tiles in the INSPIRE ATOM feed https://gdi.berlin.de/data/a_lod2/atom (EPSG:25833, DHHN2016 heights)\", \"note\": \"Used for the place Berlin (region config berlin, adapter de-be-lod2): the walls and roofs of every building of the Mitte core drawn as they are (place-tiles), and the measured height (measuredHeight, ground to the highest roof point) of each building part of Land Berlin as a height source of the OSM outlines of the core and the city blocks (place-heights, place-city-heights; after OSM height, before OSM levels). Licence read from the feed's rights element on 2026-10-22. The 925 tile zips (about 5 GB) are parsed at once by cwplans/tools/place-lod2.mjs and deleted (SHA-256 of each in the place's provenance/log.json); only transformed geometry (glTF tiles) and heights are published, in danbri/docklandia data/de/berlin/.\", \"publisher\": \"Senatsverwaltung für Stadtentwicklung, Bauen und Wohnen Berlin (Geoportal Berlin)\", \"url\": \"https://gdi.berlin.de/geonetwork/srv/api/records/3c7c49af-00a4-3bcd-bc00-20e7f0f1b7bf\"}" .
  cat:source_de_be_lod2 cat:recordStatus "Referenced source; distribution/harvest extent must be established from artifact and manifest links." .
