  cat:artifact_2 a schema:Dataset .
  cat:artifact_2 schema:name "cache/live-*.sqlite" .
  cat:artifact_2 schema:description "SQLite history of live state in the zone, one file per closed UTC month (the first, live-2026-10.sqlite, is written by the first run in November): the month's run files (cache/runs/) replayed and VACUUMed. Santander Cycles docks, lift outages, station crowding, power cuts, storm overflows, NOTAM cranes and areas (facts), AIS vessel positions (small private craft counted only), EA tide and river level readings, TfL line status, river-bus arrival counts, Open-Meteo current weather; tables sources and runs. Times are Unix seconds; schema in skill cwplans-londat-cache" .
