  cat:artifact_201 a schema:CreativeWork .
  cat:artifact_201 schema:name "docklands/wind-layer.js" .
  cat:artifact_201 schema:description "code, not data: the 3D page's Wind layer (Layers > Show > Wind, off by default; ?wind): asks the Open-Meteo forecast API in the browser, after the visitor ticks Wind, for a 5 x 4 grid of points over the model box (models icon_d2, then icon_seamless; wind at 10, 80, 120, 180 m and 975 hPa, gusts, temperature, cloud, rain) for 6 hours round the page clock; falls back to the 10 m wind of cache/latest.json; draws moving streaks along streamlines at 10 m, 120 m and 975 hPa, coloured by speed, with a readout. Nothing is stored" .
  cat:artifact_201 schema:includedInDataCatalog cat:catalogue .
