  cat:artifact_242 a schema:Dataset .
  cat:artifact_242 schema:name "docklands/data/roofs.json" .
  cat:artifact_242 schema:description "roof shapes of the low model buildings of the 3D page (model height 25 m or less): gabled, hipped or pyramidal, with the ridge line (centre, bearing), half span, half ridge length, eave and ridge heights above the model ground; skillion roofs; an outline with wings (L, T, rear outriggers) cut into parts by chords from its reflex corners, a roof a part, with the run of a gable into a crossing wing (a valley); from robust plane fits to the EA LiDAR first-return DSM 2022 inside each outline or part, else from the OSM roof tags; the model fingerprint; counts by class and the OSM roof:shape against LiDAR class table; since 2026-10-22 (operation roofs-refine) the big buildings (footprint 4,000 m2 or more, any height) cut by roof level into flat parts (up to 24), and no LiDAR roof on a building newer than the survey" .
  cat:artifact_242 schema:includedInDataCatalog cat:catalogue .
