  cat:artifact_541 a schema:Dataset .
  cat:artifact_541 schema:name "docklands/data/wildlife.json" .
  cat:artifact_541 schema:description "aggregates of open wildlife records in the model box for the Three.js port's wildlife layer: for 20 bird species and the red fox, the number of records, records per habitat class (records located to 100 m or better), per month, years and flock sizes, the weights per habitat blended with general ecology; and a 10 m habitat class raster (river, dock, pond, park, wood, garden; RLE). No record points." .
