  cat:artifact_758 a schema:Dataset .
  cat:artifact_758 schema:name "docklands/data/places/leon/tiles/*.glb" .
  cat:artifact_758 schema:description "Casco Histórico, León tiles (glTF 2.0 binary). Core, 15 level-15 cells: ground heightfield (ign-mdt05, 32 x 32 cells, outer skirts) with a 512 px JPEG texture drawn from OSM water, green, squares, streets, rail and footprints; OSM buildings and building parts extruded from the lowest ground to mean ground + eaves height, with sloped roofs (gabled, hipped, pyramidal, skillion, dome) from OSM roof:shape or the region roof rule, else flat, vertex colours (OSM building:colour / roof:colour or defaults), _FEATURE_ID_0 = row of features.json (EXT_mesh_features); roofs: OSM roof:shape {\"skillion\": 14, \"pyramidal\": 5, \"gabled\": 19, \"hipped\": 2}, region roof rule {\"hipped\": 2635}, flat 1538 City and surroundings (place-lod, surroundings: 289 tiles, 8.70 MB; city: 90 tiles, 4.63 MB): a terrain grid (16 to 32 cells by level, normals from the DEM, skirts; KHR_mesh_quantization int16 positions, int8 normals, uint16 texture coordinates; the grid as a triangle strip) of the surroundings DEM (its outer 8 km eased to a 10 km box mean) with a 256 px JPEG texture painted from ESA WorldCover land cover, Overture water, rivers, roads by class and railways (OSM-derived), and the city building footprints; in the city box, OSM buildings as blocks (oriented boxes as EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing instances of one unit box, else simplified outlines; flat tops; heights by the place-heights order); since 2026-10-21 the city blocks also from IGN España and Microsoft ML Buildings footprints (via Overture) where OSM has no building, each its own geometry class (switch in place.surround.geometry); glb extras.blocks: per block its class, height and height source (for the block card)" .
  cat:artifact_758 schema:includedInDataCatalog cat:catalogue .
  cat:artifact_758 cat:path "cwplans/docklands/data/places/leon/tiles/*.glb" .
  cat:artifact_758 cat:registeredMetadata "{\"fetched\": \"2026-10-20\", \"osm\": {\"extract\": \"osm-api-place-leon\", \"use\": \"derived\", \"what\": \"building outlines, parts, levels, roof tags, water, green, streets, rail (core, OSM API); roads, rail, water, building outlines and levels of the city and the surroundings (Overture release 2026-09-23.1, OSM-sourced records only, extract overture-osm-leon)\"}, \"path\": \"docklands/data/places/leon/tiles/*.glb\", \"produced_by\": \"tools/build-place-tiles.mjs\", \"review\": \"height_source \\\"national\\\" (2,454 buildings) = computed from Dirección General del Catastro floors (transformed data; licence class review; owner approval 2026-10-11 \\\"Catastro - yes\\\"). No Catastro geometry, id or floor count is published. height_source \\\"ghsl\\\" (177) = GHS-BUILT-H cell average (CC BY 4.0). height_source \\\"overture-height\\\" (7) and \\\"ms\\\" (6) = Overture Maps / Microsoft ML heights (ODbL, share-alike; owner 2026-10-20 \\\"Use ms/overture\\\")\", \"review_exit\": [\"catastro-ign\", \"osm-odbl\"], \"shown_on\": [\"docklands/ (the Three.js port: the globe, globe/places.js)\"], \"sources\": [\"osm\", \"ign-mdt05\", \"esa-worldcover\", \"overture-transportation\", \"overture-base\", \"overture-divisions\", \"ghsl-built-h\", \"overture-buildings\", \"ms-buildings\", \"es-catastro-inspire-bu\", \"overture-ign-floors\", \"own\", \"overture-ms-geometry\", \"overture-ign-geometry\"], \"what\": \"Casco Histórico, León tiles (glTF 2.0 binary). Core, 15 level-15 cells: ground heightfield (ign-mdt05, 32 x 32 cells, outer skirts) with a 512 px JPEG texture drawn from OSM water, green, squares, streets, rail and footprints; OSM buildings and building parts extruded from the lowest ground to mean ground + eaves height, with sloped roofs (gabled, hipped, pyramidal, skillion, dome) from OSM roof:shape or the region roof rule, else flat, vertex colours (OSM building:colour / roof:colour or defaults), _FEATURE_ID_0 = row of features.json (EXT_mesh_features); roofs: OSM roof:shape {\\\"skillion\\\": 14, \\\"pyramidal\\\": 5, \\\"gabled\\\": 19, \\\"hipped\\\": 2}, region roof rule {\\\"hipped\\\": 2635}, flat 1538 City and surroundings (place-lod, surroundings: 289 tiles, 8.70 MB; city: 90 tiles, 4.63 MB): a terrain grid (16 to 32 cells by level, normals from the DEM, skirts; KHR_mesh_quantization int16 positions, int8 normals, uint16 texture coordinates; the grid as a triangle strip) of the surroundings DEM (its outer 8 km eased to a 10 km box mean) with a 256 px JPEG texture painted from ESA WorldCover land cover, Overture water, rivers, roads by class and railways (OSM-derived), and the city building footprints; in the city box, OSM buildings as blocks (oriented boxes as EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing instances of one unit box, else simplified outlines; flat tops; heights by the place-heights order); since 2026-10-21 the city blocks also from IGN España and Microsoft ML Buildings footprints (via Overture) where OSM has no building, each its own geometry class (switch in place.surround.geometry); glb extras.blocks: per block its class, height and height source (for the block card)\"}" .
