  cat:artifact_768 schema:description "Stari Grad, Sarajevo (region sarajevo): 3D Tiles 1.1 tileset, a quadtree with REPLACE refinement over the surroundings (whole cells of the geodetic quadtree at level 10, about 70 km square round the origin, extent [17.9296875, 43.4179688, 18.984375, 44.296875]): the core (the 15 level-15 cells, full detail) as leaves, the city box [18.285, 43.815, 18.46, 43.875] as blocks from level 13, the surroundings to level 13 by distance; each tile with its ENU frame as a transform relative to its parent, a region bounding volume and a geometricError (2 x terrain vertex spacing, or the building error of its level); leaves 0" .
