  cat:artifact_802 a schema:Dataset .
  cat:artifact_802 schema:name "docklands/data/places/sarajevo/landmarks/landmarks.json" .
  cat:artifact_802 schema:description "Landmark table of Stari Grad, Sarajevo (format place-landmarks-1): every place of worship with an outline (OSM id, name, other-script name, kind, religion, centroid, footprint, Wikidata) and every landmark drawn (type, kind, of which building, height and its source, mapped or estimated and the rule, ground and top heights, radius, balcony and cone); the counts; hide_core: the core building parts replaced by landmarks; the text and machine interface (cards, describeView, search)" .
