  cat:artifact_802 cat:registeredMetadata "{\"fetched\": \"2026-10-21\", \"note\": \"OSM has few minarets mapped in Sarajevo (2026-10-21: 4 of 126 mosques); the other mosques get an estimated minaret (class \\\"estimated\\\", counted, switchable: region config place.landmarks.estimate_minarets, page ?landmarks=mapped). Ground heights from the place tiles (Copernicus DEM GLO-30, a surface model).\", \"osm\": {\"extract\": \"osm-api-landmarks-sarajevo\", \"use\": \"derived\", \"what\": \"OSM ids, names, kinds, religions, centroids and height tags of places of worship, minarets, domes and towers\"}, \"path\": \"docklands/data/places/sarajevo/landmarks/landmarks.json\", \"produced_by\": \"tools/build-place-landmarks.mjs\", \"shown_on\": [\"docklands/ (the Three.js port: the globe, globe/landmarks.js)\"], \"sources\": [\"osm\", \"copernicus-glo30\", \"own\"], \"what\": \"Landmark table of Stari Grad, Sarajevo (format place-landmarks-1): every place of worship with an outline (OSM id, name, other-script name, kind, religion, centroid, footprint, Wikidata) and every landmark drawn (type, kind, of which building, height and its source, mapped or estimated and the rule, ground and top heights, radius, balcony and cone); the counts; hide_core: the core building parts replaced by landmarks; the text and machine interface (cards, describeView, search)\"}" .
