cat:assessment {
  cat:place_sarajevo cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; manual tool rebuild. Upstream OSM changes continually; Overture uses dated releases." .
  cat:place_sarajevo cat:servingAssessment "Already optimized: 3D Tiles 1.1 / glTF quadtree, LOD, compact boxes; fetch visible tiles, retain feature IDs and attribution." .
  cat:place_sarajevo cat:rightsAssessment "Mixed source terms; ODbL-derived buildings plus credited terrain/landcover/height sources. Check per-source terms and review notes." .
  cat:place_sarajevo cat:usage "Visual 3D tiles; features.json supports search, descriptions and building cards. Not automatically loaded into KGX." .
  cat:place_london cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; manual tool rebuild. Upstream OSM changes continually; Overture uses dated releases." .
  cat:place_london cat:servingAssessment "Already optimized: 3D Tiles 1.1 / glTF quadtree, LOD, compact boxes; fetch visible tiles, retain feature IDs and attribution." .
  cat:place_london cat:rightsAssessment "Mixed source terms; ODbL-derived buildings plus credited terrain/landcover/height sources. Check per-source terms and review notes." .
  cat:place_london cat:usage "Visual 3D tiles; features.json supports search, descriptions and building cards. Not automatically loaded into KGX." .
  cat:world_detail cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; rebuild with source manifests, no automatic refresh inferred." .
  cat:world_detail cat:servingAssessment "Already partitioned spatially and by scale. Keep tiles/quantized vectors; avoid downloading country/world raw datasets at page startup." .
  cat:world_detail cat:rightsAssessment "Per-source terms: public domain, OGL, CC BY, Copernicus; regional OSM layers ODbL. No blanket grant." .
  cat:world_detail cat:usage "Globe terrain, map lines, labels and place cards; factual attributes available through readers, separate from KGX." .
  cat:web cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot, recrawl needed; source sites vary." .
  cat:web cat:servingAssessment "Evidence repository-only, gzip RDF; index normalized facts rather than load whole crawl into browser." .
  cat:web cat:rightsAssessment "Public markup does not grant an open data licence; owner scoping permission is not publisher permission." .
  cat:web cat:usage "Page-scoped JSON-LD/microdata/RDFa, N-Quads, idiom/shape and rewrite analyses; canonical portions in KGX." .
  cat:place_leon cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; manual tool rebuild. Upstream OSM changes continually; Overture uses dated releases." .
  cat:place_leon cat:servingAssessment "Already optimized: 3D Tiles 1.1 / glTF quadtree, LOD, compact boxes; fetch visible tiles, retain feature IDs and attribution." .
  cat:place_leon cat:rightsAssessment "Mixed source terms; ODbL-derived buildings plus credited terrain/landcover/height sources. Check per-source terms and review notes." .
  cat:place_leon cat:usage "Visual 3D tiles; features.json supports search, descriptions and building cards. Not automatically loaded into KGX." .
  cat:world_base cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; rebuild with source manifests, no automatic refresh inferred." .
  cat:world_base cat:servingAssessment "Already partitioned spatially and by scale. Keep tiles/quantized vectors; avoid downloading country/world raw datasets at page startup." .
  cat:world_base cat:rightsAssessment "Per-source terms: public domain, OGL, CC BY, Copernicus; regional OSM layers ODbL. No blanket grant." .
  cat:world_base cat:usage "Globe terrain, map lines, labels and place cards; factual attributes available through readers, separate from KGX." .
  cat:lds cat:changeRateAssessment "Varies by publisher/dataset; catalogue discovery date differs from resource update date." .
  cat:lds cat:servingAssessment "Bulk directories mostly served from raw GitHub, not Pages; four map overlays retained on Pages. Spatially clip/index larger layers." .
  cat:lds cat:rightsAssessment "Per-dataset OGL v2/v3, CC BY, ODC-By or stated conditions; portal membership is not a licence." .
  cat:lds cat:usage "Catalogue discovery plus selected spatial/statistical factual overlays; not every catalogue hit is harvested." .
  cat:splats cat:changeRateAssessment "Manual regeneration." .
  cat:splats cat:servingAssessment "Large binary splats already gzip compressed; lazy load; keep grouping and source metadata." .
  cat:splats cat:rightsAssessment "Model and imagery source obligations survive conversion; rendering format does not establish a new licence." .
  cat:splats cat:usage "Experimental visual rendering derived from the 3D model; not measured photogrammetry." .
  cat:world cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; rebuild with source manifests, no automatic refresh inferred." .
  cat:world cat:servingAssessment "Already partitioned spatially and by scale. Keep tiles/quantized vectors; avoid downloading country/world raw datasets at page startup." .
  cat:world cat:rightsAssessment "Per-source terms: public domain, OGL, CC BY, Copernicus; regional OSM layers ODbL. No blanket grant." .
  cat:world cat:usage "Globe terrain, map lines, labels and place cards; factual attributes available through readers, separate from KGX." .
  cat:es_nw cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; rebuild with source manifests, no automatic refresh inferred." .
  cat:es_nw cat:servingAssessment "Already partitioned spatially and by scale. Keep tiles/quantized vectors; avoid downloading country/world raw datasets at page startup." .
  cat:es_nw cat:rightsAssessment "Per-source terms: public domain, OGL, CC BY, Copernicus; regional OSM layers ODbL. No blanket grant." .
  cat:es_nw cat:usage "Globe terrain, map lines, labels and place cards; factual attributes available through readers, separate from KGX." .
  cat:textures cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; rebuild atlas when inputs change." .
  cat:textures cat:servingAssessment "Prebuilt image atlases; load relevant resolution, keep per-tile credit metadata." .
  cat:textures cat:rightsAssessment "EA OGL imagery; CC BY photo tiles require author, licence and modification credit; CC0 contributed tiles separate." .
  cat:textures cat:usage "Visual ground and facade textures; metadata links source photos and credits." .
  cat:sky cat:changeRateAssessment "Source-dependent snapshots and live fetches." .
  cat:sky cat:servingAssessment "Small cached snapshots; preserve observation/forecast/expiry times." .
  cat:sky cat:rightsAssessment "Per-source licence, credit and API terms; inspect register." .
  cat:sky cat:usage "Visual sky, satellites, weather and time-dependent context." .
  cat:uk cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; rebuild with source manifests, no automatic refresh inferred." .
  cat:uk cat:servingAssessment "Already partitioned spatially and by scale. Keep tiles/quantized vectors; avoid downloading country/world raw datasets at page startup." .
  cat:uk cat:rightsAssessment "Per-source terms: public domain, OGL, CC BY, Copernicus; regional OSM layers ODbL. No blanket grant." .
  cat:uk cat:usage "Globe terrain, map lines, labels and place cards; factual attributes available through readers, separate from KGX." .
  cat:ba cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; rebuild with source manifests, no automatic refresh inferred." .
  cat:ba cat:servingAssessment "Already partitioned spatially and by scale. Keep tiles/quantized vectors; avoid downloading country/world raw datasets at page startup." .
  cat:ba cat:rightsAssessment "Per-source terms: public domain, OGL, CC BY, Copernicus; regional OSM layers ODbL. No blanket grant." .
  cat:ba cat:usage "Globe terrain, map lines, labels and place cards; factual attributes available through readers, separate from KGX." .
  cat:model cat:changeRateAssessment "Manual builds; underlying sources change at different rates." .
  cat:model cat:servingAssessment "Existing compact JS/JSON model; layer-on-demand and spatial partitioning merit profiling for growth." .
  cat:model cat:rightsAssessment "OSM ODbL-derived geometry; OGL LiDAR and other sources; cited facts/review material; source-by-source obligations." .
  cat:model cat:usage "Detailed 3D terrain, buildings, water, roads, rail, tunnels, indoor paths, trees and feature keys; cited factual layers." .
  cat:portals cat:changeRateAssessment "Varies; discovery is not evidence that a resource is current or downloaded." .
  cat:portals cat:servingAssessment "Bulk directories use raw GitHub. Keep catalogue separate from extracted layers; use GeoPackages for GIS and indexed subsets for browser." .
  cat:portals cat:rightsAssessment "Record-level terms retained; do not assign OGL simply because a public portal lists a dataset." .
  cat:portals cat:usage "data.gov.uk, planning.data.gov.uk, borough, Nomis, ONS and national discovery plus selected factual/spatial extracts." .
  cat:atlas cat:changeRateAssessment "Rebuilt with inputs." .
  cat:atlas cat:servingAssessment "Index first, entity details on demand; avoid treating duplicated export bytes as extra observations." .
  cat:atlas cat:rightsAssessment "Mixed source rights, ODbL-derived outlines and joined review sources." .
  cat:atlas cat:usage "Joined factual/spatial browser index, derived from registry/model/other inputs." .
  cat:place_stuttgart cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; manual tool rebuild. Upstream OSM changes continually; Overture uses dated releases." .
  cat:place_stuttgart cat:servingAssessment "Already optimized: 3D Tiles 1.1 / glTF quadtree, LOD, compact boxes; fetch visible tiles, retain feature IDs and attribution." .
  cat:place_stuttgart cat:rightsAssessment "Mixed source terms; ODbL-derived buildings plus credited terrain/landcover/height sources. Check per-source terms and review notes." .
  cat:place_stuttgart cat:usage "Visual 3D tiles; features.json supports search, descriptions and building cards. Not automatically loaded into KGX." .
  cat:postcodes cat:changeRateAssessment "ONSPD editions periodically; local outputs rebuilt manually." .
  cat:postcodes cat:servingAssessment "Small JSON/CSV; retain stable postcode keys and geocoding uncertainty." .
  cat:postcodes cat:rightsAssessment "OGL with required ONS, OS and Royal Mail notices; OSM-derived streets/counts tracked separately." .
  cat:postcodes cat:usage "E14 postcode status, ward, coordinate, company/sales aggregates and discovery evidence; registry join framework." .
