  cat:registry cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot rebuilds; businesses, construction and hours can change daily." .
  cat:registry cat:servingAssessment "Small indexes and entity cards; keep stable IDs, join confidence and source dates. KGX handles cross-source queries." .
  cat:registry cat:rightsAssessment "Mixed OGL/CC0/ODbL/CC BY, source conditions and website scoping reviews. Geometry joins do not erase rights." .
  cat:registry cat:usage "Factual entity layer and main KGX inputs: buildings, companies, premises, brands, heritage, construction, water, facades and website facts." .
  cat:place_uk_lite cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; manual tool rebuild. Upstream OSM changes continually; Overture uses dated releases." .
  cat:place_uk_lite cat:servingAssessment "Already optimized: 3D Tiles 1.1 / glTF quadtree, LOD, compact boxes; fetch visible tiles, retain feature IDs and attribution." .
