  cat:place_uk_lite cat:usage "Visual 3D tiles; features.json supports search, descriptions and building cards. Not automatically loaded into KGX." .
  cat:cwg cat:changeRateAssessment "Website snapshots; can become stale quickly." .
  cat:cwg cat:servingAssessment "Repository-only evidence excluded from Pages; do not expose raw material by adding download links to Pages." .
  cat:cwg cat:rightsAssessment "No general open licence; scoping review, facts vs copied expression and database extraction must be distinguished." .
  cat:cwg cat:usage "Raw/parsed estate directory and indoor-map evidence; some factual extracts lifted to KGX." .
  cat:tfl cat:changeRateAssessment "Snapshot; manual updates." .
  cat:tfl cat:servingAssessment "Repository-only evidence excluded from Pages; derived model review separate." .
  cat:tfl cat:rightsAssessment "FOI release and accessibility are not general reuse permission; check source-specific notices." .
  cat:tfl cat:usage "Station 3D source models and plans for underground reconstruction/evidence." .
