  cat:place_dublin cat:servingAssessment "Already optimized: 3D Tiles 1.1 / glTF quadtree, LOD, compact boxes; fetch visible tiles, retain feature IDs and attribution." .
  cat:place_dublin cat:rightsAssessment "Mixed source terms; ODbL-derived buildings plus credited terrain/landcover/height sources. Check per-source terms and review notes." .
