  cat:feeds cat:changeRateAssessment "Source-specific live updates; committed snapshots require refresh; RSS discovery is not a complete event archive." .
  cat:feeds cat:servingAssessment "Cache normalized small responses, use TTLs and backoff, disclose stale observations; large KML spatially clip." .
  cat:feeds cat:rightsAssessment "Mixed open licences, source API terms and scoping-only sources; each KML/event source keeps its status." .
  cat:feeds cat:usage "Visual overlays, time-series/live panels, events, alerts, underground source evidence and KML discovery/copies." .
  cat:cache cat:changeRateAssessment "Hourly history workflow; latest rewritten each run; GIS exports rebuild separately." .
  cat:cache cat:servingAssessment "Latest JSON for browser; SQLite/month and delta archives for analysis; GeoPackage indexed GIS. History excluded from Pages." .
  cat:cache cat:rightsAssessment "Mixed layers retain their own licences; AIS scoping review. Export container is not a blanket relicensing." .
  cat:cache cat:usage "Normalized live snapshots/history plus GeoPackage exports of core, Datastore and portal layers." .
  cat:raw cat:changeRateAssessment "Manual fetch snapshots." .
  cat:raw cat:servingAssessment "Build inputs, not startup payload; ignored raw downloads are accounted separately where recorded." .
  cat:raw cat:rightsAssessment "Per-source rights; raw restricted originals may deliberately be absent." .
  cat:raw cat:usage "Raw source extracts, station control facts and original corridor model; excludes ignored downloads." .
  cat:photos cat:changeRateAssessment "Append-only contributed sets; annotations may be revised." .
  cat:photos cat:servingAssessment "Image originals for evidence; use derived atlases/thumbs in rendering." .
  cat:photos cat:rightsAssessment "Owner contributions declared CC0 where README states; third-party subjects/marks and privacy decisions remain separate." .
  cat:photos cat:usage "Original contributed photos, annotations, camera/calibration and facade evidence." .
  cat:documentation cat:changeRateAssessment "Changes when tools/audits are run." .
  cat:documentation cat:servingAssessment "Small reports/manifests; generated metadata can still grow; this residual family also contains software." .
  cat:documentation cat:rightsAssessment "Project metadata lacks a clear blanket data grant; underlying quoted/source facts retain their provenance." .
  cat:documentation cat:usage "Data-quality findings, source-discovery coverage and pipeline metadata alongside software/documentation." .
  cat:kgx cat:changeRateAssessment "Rebuild operations create new versions; browser worker package update does not rebuild graph contents." .
  cat:kgx cat:servingAssessment "Shardborough indexed range-read store already used. Keep full export and browser subset distinct; benchmark joins and cold/warm reads before considering server database." .
  cat:kgx cat:rightsAssessment "Per-graph mixed source licence text. Browser subset and full export have different membership; conversion to RDF does not remove obligations." .
  cat:kgx cat:usage "RDF factual layers, source evidence, named graph provenance, immutable versions, complete export and indexed browser subset." .
  cat:catalogue cat:limitation "Source records and registered artifacts include discovery metadata, software and duplicate representations. Source counts are not counts of independently acquired datasets. Physical byte totals are not unique information volume. No new source licence grant is made here." .
}
